    "body": "WPT tests need a signal for _when_ it's time to verify the focus change.\r\n\r\nWill this endpoint block until focus (`activeElement`) actually changed ([success](https://w3c.github.io/webdriver/#dfn-success))?\r\n\r\nWhen there's nothing to focus in the given direction ([error](https://w3c.github.io/webdriver/#dfn-errors)), I think blocking until seqnav has completed makes sense too.",
